  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:03.740" end="00:05.780" ttm:agent="v1">완벽한 날씨</p>
      <p begin="00:05.780" end="00:07.700" ttm:agent="v1">딱 맞는 playlist</p>
      <p begin="00:07.700" end="00:09.650" ttm:agent="v1">오늘의 selfie</p>
      <p begin="00:09.650" end="00:11.660" ttm:agent="v1">I say, &quot;I'm lucky&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:11.660" end="00:13.620" ttm:agent="v1">세상은 chocolate</p>
      <p begin="00:13.620" end="00:15.690" ttm:agent="v1">삼키자, so sweet</p>
      <p begin="00:15.690" end="00:21.230" ttm:agent="v1">긍정의 cheat key, lucky girl syndrome</p>
      <p begin="00:21.230" end="00:22.790" ttm:agent="v1">I don't need</p>
      <p begin="00:22.790" end="00:25.120" ttm:agent="v1">어떤 golden ticket도</p>
      <p begin="00:25.120" end="00:26.680" ttm:agent="v1">All I need</p>
      <p begin="00:26.680" end="00:29.120" ttm:agent="v1">내 자신을 믿는 것</p>
      <p begin="00:29.120" end="00:30.680" ttm:agent="v1">Finally</p>
      <p begin="00:30.680" end="00:32.670" ttm:agent="v1">다 이뤄질 거야</p>
      <p begin="00:32.670" end="00:35.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">매일 주문을 외워 (mwah)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.350" end="00:38.630" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, luck, yeah, I'm a lucky girl</p>
      <p begin="00:38.630" end="00:40.280" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, you're a lucky girl</p>
      <p begin="00:40.280" end="00:41.830" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we're so lucky</p>
      <p begin="00:41.830" end="00:44.200" ttm:agent="v1">Luck</p>
      <p begin="00:44.200" end="00:46.190" ttm:agent="v1">주문을 걸어 luck</p>
      <p begin="00:46.190" end="00:48.190" ttm:agent="v1">난 정말 lucky girl</p>
      <p begin="00:48.190" end="00:51.710" ttm:agent="v1">넌 정말 lucky girl, girl, girl, girl</p>
      <p begin="00:51.710" end="00:53.990" ttm:agent="v1">찍어봐 breakfast</p>
      <p begin="00:53.990" end="00:55.750" ttm:agent="v1">선택은 best choice</p>
      <p begin="00:55.750" end="00:57.630" ttm:agent="v1">도착한 crossroad</p>
      <p begin="00:57.630" end="00:59.680" ttm:agent="v1">신호는 green light</p>
      <p begin="00:59.680" end="01:01.630" ttm:agent="v1">마주친 눈에</p>
      <p begin="01:01.630" end="01:03.670" ttm:agent="v1">터진 웃음에</p>
      <p begin="01:03.670" end="01:08.630" ttm:agent="v1">붙여봐 hashtag, lucky girl syndrome</p>
      <p begin="01:08.630" end="01:10.750" ttm:agent="v1">설렘이</p>
      <p begin="01:10.750" end="01:13.230" ttm:agent="v1">계속 차오르는 걸</p>
      <p begin="01:13.230" end="01:14.870" ttm:agent="v1">I believe</p>
      <p begin="01:14.870" end="01:17.150" ttm:agent="v1">이뤄져 믿는 대로</p>
      <p begin="01:17.150" end="01:18.670" ttm:agent="v1">Finally</p>
      <p begin="01:18.670" end="01:20.630" ttm:agent="v1">넌 이유를 아니?</p>
      <p begin="01:20.630" end="01:23.310" ttm:agent="v1">Together, you and me</p>
      <p begin="01:23.310" end="01:26.160" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, luck, yeah, I'm a lucky girl</p>
      <p begin="01:26.160" end="01:28.120" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, you're a lucky girl</p>
      <p begin="01:28.120" end="01:29.670" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we're so lucky</p>
      <p begin="01:29.670" end="01:32.120" ttm:agent="v1">Luck</p>
      <p begin="01:32.120" end="01:34.150" ttm:agent="v1">주문을 걸어 luck</p>
      <p begin="01:34.150" end="01:36.120" ttm:agent="v1">난 정말 lucky girl</p>
      <p begin="01:36.120" end="01:39.910" ttm:agent="v1">넌 정말 lucky girl, girl, girl, girl</p>
      <p begin="01:39.910" end="01:47.910" ttm:agent="v1">♫</p>
      <p begin="01:55.680" end="02:00.110" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, my girl, 주문을 걸어 say</p>
      <p begin="02:00.110" end="02:03.790" ttm:agent="v1">That's my girl, lucky girl syndrome</p>
      <p begin="02:03.790" end="02:08.150" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, my girl, 주문을 걸어 say</p>
